{"task_id": "Mbpp/95", "solution": "def Find_Min_Length(lists):\n    if not isinstance(lists, list):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input must be a list of lists\")\n    if len(lists) == 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input list is empty\")\n    min_len = None\n    for sub in lists:\n        if not isinstance(sub, list):\n            raise TypeError(\"All elements of the top-level list must be lists\")\n        l = len(sub)\n        if min_len is None or l < min_len:\n            min_len = l\n            if min_len == 0:\n                return 0\n    return min_len"}
