{"task_id": "Mbpp/223", "solution": "def is_majority(arr, n, x):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if an element x is the majority element in a sorted array.\n    The majority element occurs more than n/2 times.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _find_first_occurrence(array, length, target):\n        low, high = 0, length - 1\n        first_idx = None\n        while low <= high:\n            mid = (low + high) // 2\n            if array[mid] == target:\n                first_idx = mid\n                high = mid - 1\n            elif array[mid] < target:\n                low = mid + 1\n            else:\n                high = mid - 1\n        return first_idx\n\n    first_occurrence_idx = _find_first_occurrence(arr, n, x)\n\n    if first_occurrence_idx is None:\n        return False\n\n    majority_threshold_idx = first_occurrence_idx + n // 2\n\n    if majority_threshold_idx < n and arr[majority_threshold_idx] == x:\n        return True\n    else:\n        return False"}
