{"task_id": "Mbpp/476", "solution": "def big_sum(array):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the sum of the largest and smallest value in a given array.\n    Assumes the array is non-empty and contains only numeric values.\n    \"\"\"\n    min_val = float('inf')\n    max_val = float('-inf')\n\n    for num in array:\n        if num < min_val:\n            min_val = num\n        if num > max_val:\n            max_val = num\n\n    return min_val + max_val"}
