{"task_id": "Mbpp/806", "solution": "def max_run_uppercase(s):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the maximum consecutive run of uppercase ASCII characters in a string.\n    \"\"\"\n    if s is None:\n        raise ValueError(\"input must be a string\")\n    if not isinstance(s, str):\n        raise ValueError(\"input must be a string\")\n\n    max_run = 0\n    current_run = 0\n    for char in s:\n        if 'A' <= char <= 'Z':\n            current_run += 1\n            if current_run > max_run:\n                max_run = current_run\n        else:\n            current_run = 0\n    return max_run"}
